# {{ .ProjectName }} ⚡

> Modern Command-Line Interface and Interactive TUI built in Go with [Cobra](https://github.com/spf13/cobra), [Bubble Tea](https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea), [Lipgloss](https://github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss), and [Viper](https://github.com/spf13/viper).

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
go mod tidy
```

### 2. Run CLI Help
```bash
go run main.go --help
```

### 3. Launch Interactive Terminal UI
```bash
go run main.go interactive
```

---

## 📦 Project Architecture

```text
├── cmd/
│   ├── root.go         # Cobra root command & persistent flags
│   ├── interactive.go  # Bubble Tea interactive TUI trigger
│   └── version.go      # Version & build info command
├── internal/
│   ├── config/         # Viper configuration loader
│   └── tui/            # Bubble Tea models & Lipgloss styling
├── Makefile            # Build and development commands
└── main.go             # Application entry point
```

---

## 🛠️ Build & Development

- **Build binary:**
  ```bash
  make build
  # Generates executable in bin/{{ .SafeName }}
  ```

- **Run tests:**
  ```bash
  make test
  ```

- **Run directly:**
  ```bash
  ./bin/{{ .SafeName }} interactive
  ```
